  "description": "Cantina, the ultimate in simplicity and style. Redesigned SuperCruise frame available in five fresh flavors, and outfitted with a super comfy oversized Del Sol cruiser springer saddle and custom Del Sol cruiser bars that are always within reach. Alloy rims and stainless steel spokes are lightweight and rust free. Cantina, is your \"all-coasts\" (and all points in-between) solution for the slow lane.\nHi-ten steel SuperCruise frame with Step-Thru option\nSimple one-speed, coaster brake drivetrain\nCustom Del Sol Cruiser bars\nLightweight & rust-free alloy rims and stainless-steel spokes\nKenda Komfort 26x2.125 cruiser tires\nDel Sol cruiser springer saddle",
